{
  "title": "Agent benchmark: model x context",
  "description": "Lanternfly Labs data agent. Phase 1: Sonnet 5.5, 25 core questions, LangSmith experiments. Phase 2: Haiku 5.5 and Gemma 4 26B, 64 questions x 3 contexts x 3 reps, plus the context-fix rerun (phase2-v2).",
  "project": "agent-ready-analytics",
  "feedback_key": "correct",
  "outcome_key": "outcome",
  "window": {"start": "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z", "end": "2026-10-18T03:00:00Z"},
  "models": {
    "Haiku": "anthropic:claude-haiku-5-5",
    "Gemma": "ollama:gemma4:26b"
  },
  "phase1": {
    "pattern": "^context-(raw|docs|full)-[0-9a-f]{8}$",
    "min_scored_runs": 25,
    "pin": {"raw": null, "docs": null, "full": null}
  },
  "rows": [
    {
      "height": 0.6,
      "items": [
        {"width": 40, "chart_type": "text",
         "markdown": "### Governed context beats a bigger model\nRaw tables: Haiku 66%, Gemma 23%. With the context layer: Haiku 99.5% (docs), local Gemma 83% (full). Sonnet in Phase 1 went from 76% to 100% on the original questions."},
        {"width": 20, "title": "Phase 2 runs", "chart_type": "kpi",
         "series": {"name": "Runs", "run": "phase2", "metric": "run_count"}},
        {"width": 20, "title": "Haiku cost, 576 runs", "chart_type": "kpi",
         "description": "Phase 2. Gemma ran locally on an RTX 3090.",
         "series": {"name": "Cost", "run": "phase2", "model": "Haiku", "metric": "total_cost"}},
        {"width": 20, "title": "Sonnet cost, Phase 1", "chart_type": "kpi",
         "series": {"name": "Cost", "source": "phase1", "metric": "total_cost"}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "height": 1,
      "items": [
        {"width": 33, "title": "Haiku accuracy by context", "chart_type": "top-k",
         "description": "Phase 2, all 64 questions, 3 reps.",
         "series": {"name": "Accuracy", "run": "phase2", "model": "Haiku", "metric": "feedback_score_avg", "group_by": "context_level"}},
        {"width": 33, "title": "Gemma accuracy by context", "chart_type": "top-k",
         "description": "Phase 2, local on an RTX 3090.",
         "series": {"name": "Accuracy", "run": "phase2", "model": "Gemma", "metric": "feedback_score_avg", "group_by": "context_level"}},
        {"width": 34, "title": "Sonnet accuracy by context (Phase 1)", "chart_type": "top-k",
         "description": "25 core questions, one rep. Bars are the raw, docs and full experiments.",
         "series": {"name": "Accuracy", "source": "phase1", "metric": "feedback_score_avg", "group_by": "project"}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "height": 1,
      "items": [
        {"width": 33, "title": "Gemma outcomes", "chart_type": "pie",
         "description": "Phase 2. Haiku never hit the step limit.",
         "series": {"name": "Runs", "run": "phase2", "model": "Gemma", "metric": "run_count", "group_by": "outcome"}},
        {"width": 33, "title": "Gemma on the 33 hard questions", "chart_type": "top-k",
         "description": "The semantic layer matters most on multi-step questions.",
         "series": {"name": "Accuracy", "run": "phase2", "model": "Gemma", "split": "hard", "metric": "feedback_score_avg", "group_by": "context_level"}},
        {"width": 34, "title": "Context fix: Gemma, full context", "chart_type": "top-k",
         "description": "phase2 = original context, phase2-v2 = dimension-description and contract-ARR doc fixes.",
         "series": {"name": "Accuracy", "model": "Gemma", "level": "full", "metric": "feedback_score_avg", "group_by": "run_id"}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "height": 1,
      "items": [
        {"width": 33, "title": "Haiku median tokens per run", "chart_type": "top-k",
         "description": "Raw tables cost about 3x the tokens of docs or full.",
         "series": {"name": "Tokens", "run": "phase2", "model": "Haiku", "metric": "median_tokens", "group_by": "context_level"}},
        {"width": 33, "title": "Gemma median tokens per run", "chart_type": "top-k",
         "series": {"name": "Tokens", "run": "phase2", "model": "Gemma", "metric": "median_tokens", "group_by": "context_level"}},
        {"width": 34, "title": "Sonnet median tokens per run (Phase 1)", "chart_type": "top-k",
         "series": {"name": "Tokens", "source": "phase1", "metric": "median_tokens", "group_by": "project"}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "height": 1,
      "items": [
        {"width": 33, "title": "Haiku median latency (s)", "chart_type": "top-k",
         "series": {"name": "Latency", "run": "phase2", "model": "Haiku", "metric": "latency_p50", "group_by": "context_level"}},
        {"width": 33, "title": "Gemma step-limit rate", "chart_type": "top-k",
         "description": "Runs that hit the 60-step LangGraph limit.",
         "series": {"name": "Step limit", "run": "phase2", "model": "Gemma", "metric": "error_rate", "group_by": "context_level"}},
        {"width": 34, "title": "Context fix: Haiku, full context", "chart_type": "top-k",
         "series": {"name": "Accuracy", "model": "Haiku", "level": "full", "metric": "feedback_score_avg", "group_by": "run_id"}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "height": 0.5,
      "items": [
        {"width": 100, "chart_type": "text",
         "markdown": "**Notes.** Phase 2 charts count only root traces that carry the backfilled `correct` feedback, so they match `evals/results/*/runs.jsonl`. Cost uses LangSmith's model price map, which can differ slightly from the harness's own cost. Latency is trace duration. Confidence intervals and per-trap results are in `docs/REPORT.md`."}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
